      "description": "A young orangutan with dark skin and reddish-brown fur, looking directly at the camera with large, expressive eyes. The image is a close-up, focusing on the orangutan's face and upper body, with a blurred background suggesting a natural habitat. The orangutan appears to be hanging or reaching with one arm, and its expression is innocent and curious, which contributes to the meme's humorous effect.",
