      "label": "baby_orangutan_with_text",
      "description": "A close-up scene featuring a baby orangutan looking directly at the camera, with overlaid text that reads 'can you tag your friend tell them i found their baby pic.' The orangutan's innocent expression and the humorous text create a scene of absurd social media behavior applied to an animal.",
